      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5fb73a1eea850753021f6c1c|full_name} It's intended. We still plan to revisit this in the future with a more granular approach for creators in the SDK (additional warnings about the cap, suggesting using heightened Aniso only on one or two textures per material) but 16x Aniso tended to be past the point of diminishing returns for the Quest - and just in general, the difference is difficult to spot.\n\nhttps://images.nvidia.com/geforce-com/international/comparisons/titanfall-2/titanfall-2-texture-filtering-interactive-comparison-001-anisotropic-16x-vs-anisotropic-8x.html",
      "viewerReactions": null,
